WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,210
It seems like this place has been pretty much ransacked.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:15,160
This is why I stayed here because I couldn’t move away.

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,160
I really can’t fit the big stuff inside.

4
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:21,520
It's a forest

5
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,520
Okay. Firewood has been used up too fast recently.

6
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,520
I just agree. Let's put it into a corner of the space.

7
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:34,420
So much meat is brought to you. Don’t waste it.

8
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:39,980
Sure enough, any living creature will faint as soon as it enters my space.

9
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:45,420
If you don’t take the bait, then I’ll give you something sweet.

10
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:50,690
Eighteen heads, enough pork for this year
